        "text_CfcJd4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We're excited to offer a GVM package from Offroad Industries that can transform your Ram 2500HD. This upgrade enhances your vehicle's overall engineering, including the ability to fit bigger tires.</p><p>We understand that many RAM Australia-delivered RAM 2500s are currently in the NB1 Category, and we have an excellent solution to upgrade your vehicle. We can elevate your Ram 2500HD to either a 5300GVM or even a 5550GVM. This substantial upgrade is achieved through the integration of top-of-the-line suspension components from Fox & BDS, ensuring superior performance and durability.</p><p>As a federally approved second-stage manufacturer, we have the authority to upgrade your vehicle's GVM on the federal database.</p>"
          }
